# Event extraction qualification audit checklist

- [ ] Acceptable-set and candidate JSON reject unknown fields and non-finite values.
- [ ] Raw source SHA-256 and every event source-span SHA-256 are recomputed.
- [ ] UTF-8 byte spans are bounded, ordered and non-overlapping.
- [ ] Every hidden anchor appears exactly once in source and maps one-to-one to one event.
- [ ] Candidate event kind/status remain within the frozen acceptable set.
- [ ] Every candidate edge is required, optional or explicitly forbidden; unmatched edges fail.
- [ ] Every MERGE target has at least two distinct parent anchors.
- [ ] A mechanical PASS remains pending independent semantic audit.
- [ ] Candidate-authored verdict fields are impossible under the strict v1 trajectory schema.
